{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"b60da86b9d695b2274e870d13fe7f4426b75892d","body":"### Linked issue\n\n[WORK-396](http://21.6.29.118:3210/multica-trial/issues/WORK-396), contract v2.\n\n### Type of change\n\n- [x] Enhancement\n\n### Reasoning\n\nThe sidebar now switches the same compact session cards between By project and By directory. Project grouping combines the main checkout and linked worktrees; directory grouping uses each session's actual execution cwd. Both keep the same separate Pinned section and session actions.\n\nDirectory selection and binding move to Files and Changes in Explorer. Workspaces and terminals opens the existing global workspace list from Explorer or Open project, including workspaces with no conversation. Browsing a directory and opening a resource preserve the original conversation and execution cwd.\n\n### Goals\n\n- Reuse the existing compact card content and project status icons; retain rename, pin, labels, read, archive, hover and context-menu actions.\n- Keep explicit file/Git targets scoped to the selected session and directory.\n- Preserve existing workspace, terminal, service and layout ownership.\n\n### Non-goals\n\nExecution-directory switching and new protocol or resource lifecycles are outside this change.\n\n### QA\n\nFull workspace typecheck, lint, formatting and commit hooks pass. The session projection/model file passes all 13 cases. Focused real-daemon Playwright runs cover all 18 session/resource cases across the recorded matrix and follow-ups, plus a running-service restoration case. The final resource regression explicitly closes the sheet after selecting current/other workspaces at 1200/390 and in status grouping, preserves terminal IDs and service operations, and opens an independent terminal after every conversation is archived.\n\n[QA record and raw logs](https://github.com/zfan2356/paseo/blob/agent/sol/work-396/docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/README.md) include 1200/390 screenshots, the actual compact terminal surface, the service case and failed assertions with their resolution. Independent review WORK-399 passed (Taste: Good, no remaining required fixes). Project and status resource rows dismiss the sheet before navigating, including retained and current workspaces.\n\nBrowser Chromium on Linux is exercised; iOS, Android and packaged Electron are not exercised. GitHub Actions is disabled for this repository, and Multica's GitHub integration is not configured; both are recorded task exemptions.\n\n### Checklist\n\n- [x] One focused change\n- [x] `npm run typecheck` passes\n- [x] `npm run lint` passes\n- [x] `npm run format` passes\n- [x] QA evidence\n- [x] Tests added or updated where it made sense\n","files":[{"path":"docs/architecture.md","additions":3,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/explorer-sidebar.md","additions":13,"deletions":6,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/README.md","additions":50,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/browser-final.txt","additions":486,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/browser-matrix.txt","additions":820,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/build-server.txt","additions":76,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/commit-checks.txt","additions":103,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/empty-sessions-home-1200.png","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/empty-sessions-home-390.png","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/group-directory-1200.png","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/group-directory-390.png","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/qa-evidence/session-grouping/group-project-1200.png"